Error [E0109]: A module binding must use a supported scalar, string, or immutable integer-array literal
  --> tests/ui/module_array_computed_element.jet:1:14
    |
  1 | BAD_TABLE :: [Int]{1 + 2}
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Module globals need a value shape that every execution tier can initialize before `fn run`
 Fix: Use an integer, float, bool, char, or immutable string literal, or an immutable `[Int]`/`[U8]` literal with integer-literal elements
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0109
